# Tests Directory

This directory contains test files for the <%= skillName %> skill, organized by testing layer:

- **structure.test.ts**: Layer 1 - Structural validation (metadata, file layout, naming)
- **scripts.test.ts**: Layer 2 - Deterministic unit tests for executable scripts
- **behavior.meta.json**: Layer 3 - Behavioral evals (LLM-as-a-judge test cases)

## Running Tests

```bash
# Run all tests
pnpm nx test @shinobi/skill-<%= skillName %>

# Run with coverage
pnpm nx test @shinobi/skill-<%= skillName %> --coverage

# Run specific test file
pnpm nx test @shinobi/skill-<%= skillName %> -- tests/structure.test.ts
```

## Test Evidence

After running tests, an `EVIDENCE.md` file is generated in the skill root with test results for FedRAMP compliance.

